# Test coins — NEVER disable (owner 2026-08-16)

Test coins stay in the app on **iOS**, **Android**, and **Google Play** store builds. Do **not** turn them off.

## Stay on

- Keep `areTestCoinsEnabled()` on (do not gate store builds off)
- Keep `VITE_ALLOW_TEST_COINS=1` in `.env.store` / `.env.store.example`
- Keep battle score + gift animation for `giftSource=test_coins` in production
- Keep More Options password mint (login + server password, not admin)
- Keep them in spectator **and** creator live More Options

## Still never money

- No IAP, no Stripe, no real wallet, no 60/40, no GBP payout, no `paidCoinLots`
- Battle points + gift video animation only (`financialValueGbp: 0`)

## Forbidden

- Do not set `VITE_ALLOW_TEST_COINS=0`
- Do not hide the More Options test-coin control on store builds
- Do not add production mint / battle-score kill switches that remove the feature
- Do not delete `src/lib/testCoins.ts` or the More panel mint UI
- Do not "clean up" test coins as unused

Default: **test coins stay. Never touch to remove.**
